    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You call upon your dragonmark's power to heal the wounded. Your dragonmark channels a burst of vitality energy, healing a living creature. If you use healing word on a living target, they restore 4 Hit Points.</p>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing increases by 4.</p>"
